WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.800
God forbid my daughter goes bald because of cradle cap.

00:00:04.220 --> 00:00:06.820
I tried a few things to get rid of her cradle cap,

00:00:06.821 --> 00:00:09.241
but the one that worked the best was Castor oil.

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:12.140
Compared to coconut oil and olive oil,

00:00:12.141 --> 00:00:13.921
Castor oil is thick.

00:00:14.020 --> 00:00:17.740
It absorbs quickly in her scalp and makes her hair smooth.

00:00:17.741 --> 00:00:19.801
To easily comb out her cradle cap,

00:00:19.980 --> 00:00:22.300
it's important to get authentic Castor oil.

00:00:22.301 --> 00:00:24.881
I got this one right here on the TikTok shop.

00:00:24.900 --> 00:00:29.840
Authentic Castor oil is always thick and it has a distinctive smell.

00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:34.060
I use the Castor oil to grease baby girl's entire scalp.

00:00:34.061 --> 00:00:36.661
And then once I do that, I go ahead and massage it.

00:00:36.662 --> 00:00:39.681
Then I comb it out and then give her a hair wash.

00:00:40.220 --> 00:00:43.440
Let me know in the comments how you got rid of your baby's cradle cap.
